repository-code: "https://github.com/hoanglinh221191/TITAN-BIE-PB"
abstract: "Source release of TITAN for the revised paper: a boundary-integral Poisson-Boltzmann solver on curved node-patch cells of a charge-graded analytic solvent-excluded surface, with convergence-tested self quadrature, a hierarchical Cartesian multipole far field, and a sparse near-field block ILU(0) preconditioner for GMRES. It includes the full TITAN source, a user manual, runnable examples (including the paper's 27 proteins from the deposited PDB files), and the data and scripts behind the paper's tables and figures."
keywords:
  - Poisson-Boltzmann
  - boundary integral equation
  - solvent-excluded surface
  - treecode
  - biomolecular electrostatics
  - solvation free energy
  - ILU(0)
  - GMRES
